\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. I Need Thee every hour,
\par Most gracious Lord;
\par No tender voice like Thine
\par Can peace afford.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 I need Thee, O I need Thee,
\par Every hour I need Thee;
\par O bless me now, my Saviour;
\par I come to Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I need Thee every hour;
\par Stay Thou near by:
\par Temptations lose their power
\par When Thou art nigh.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 I need Thee, O I need Thee,
\par Every hour I need Thee;
\par O bless me now, my Saviour;
\par I come to Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. I need Thee every hour,
\par In joy or pain;
\par Come quickly and abide,
\par Or life is vain.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 I need Thee, O I need Thee,
\par Every hour I need Thee;
\par O bless me now, my Saviour;
\par I come to Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. I neeed Thee every hour;
\par Teach me Thy will;
\par And Thy rich promises
\par In me fulfil.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 I need Thee, O I need Thee,
\par Every hour I need Thee;
\par O bless me now, my Saviour;
\par I come to Thee.
\par \f1 
